flowchart TB
    Step1["<b>🔍 Step 1 · RAG Retrieval</b><br/><br/>Embedding + Qdrant hybrid search top-20<br/>↓<br/>RRF Fusion + Rerank → Feed to LLM"]

    Step2["<b>⚡ Step 2 · Parallel Execution</b><br/><br/>🤖 A1 Focus ID Agent — Identify legal relations / disputes<br/>🤖 A4 Risk Assessment Agent — Scan potential legal risks"]

    Step3["<b>📝 Step 3 · Sequential Analysis</b><br/><br/>🤖 A2 Legal Analysis Agent<br/>Based on A1 focus + retrieved laws<br/>Output analysis with [n] citations"]

    Step4["<b>🛡️ Step 4 · Citation Validation ⭐</b><br/><br/>🤖 A3 Citation Validation Agent<br/>Verify each [n] citation is genuinely in retrieved docs<br/>Tag 'hallucination' / 'verified'"]

    Step5["<b>📦 Step 5 · Integration & Output</b><br/><br/>① Filter A3-tagged hallucination citations<br/>② Deduplicate by law + article<br/>③ Enrich metadata (official source / publisher / status)<br/>④ Renumber [1] [2] [3]<br/>⑤ Recompute confidence score"]

    Input["📥 Case Input"]:::inputStyle
    Output["📤 Final Output<br/>Each point linked to official source<br/>One-click jump to official law database"]:::outputStyle

    Input ==> Step1
    Step1 ==> Step2
    Step2 ==> Step3
    Step3 ==> Step4
    Step4 ==> Step5
    Step5 ==> Output

